    <guid isPermaLink="false">6766a9241e823e72d39d8e97</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Dec 2024 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客，甜甜想跟大家一起来探讨如何训练表达能力、逻辑思维能力，以及你想要成为什么样的人。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📝 &nbsp;Show Notes：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a>希望能跟大家一起驱散迷雾，修复磁场，迎接新年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a>记性变差、表达能力下降，连锁反应让我有了危机意识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="232">03:52</a>如果有灵感，及时整理出来，积累素材</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">04:51</a>推荐APP，阅读记录和flomo</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="425">07:05</a>妙妙屋2025年笔友招募，让我们一起记录平凡却又独一无二的日子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="544">09:04</a>你要明白自己的第一诉求才能打破内耗，提高执行力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="858">14:18</a>太多口语化的表达，其实也会影响思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="945">15:45</a>我需要质疑也接受碰撞，我们是真实的人，没有象牙塔，没有乌托邦</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期小贴士</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.BGM《Better》</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.阅读记录APP，12月数据汇总</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlprF8vRqTFR2Zr-89W4KKvTCLEI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>3.播客《搞钱女孩》卡尼酱的重点摘录</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvo-QTSLprEIjnlcqjMck_RW0SlV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>4.甜甜各个平台的账号，欢迎大家关注</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq6PKMzkSu1vM6ONL8WqabAxXjLt.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
