  <item>
    <title>甜甜落日灯塔#004 | 我之燃烧，寂然无声：“何妨如一颗星闪过，忘记缤纷的灯”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bc5b8533591c27be01a7d5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66bc5b8533591c27be01a7d5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Aug 2024 07:23:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见！甜甜短暂GAP！强势回归！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📝 &nbsp;Show Notes：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a>简单、仓促、急忙结束了我四年多的工作生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">02:55</a>“何妨如一颗星闪过/忘记缤纷的灯/随一本书解困/逃出心中斗争”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a>很感恩能遇见这么多的同频朋友，因书结缘，他们是像礼物般的存在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">06:28</a>佳佳：优秀是你的使命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">07:04</a>冰冰：少女请扬帆起航，梦想之舟必将驶向星辰彼岸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">07:47</a>琳妹：我本具足和爱满自溢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a>“好好生活，保持好奇，持续光彩夺目，寻找生活中的美。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a>这一场传阅，缓缓流动，只需要把一切交给眼睛和时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a>原文分享《克林索尔的最后夏天》</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期小贴士</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.BGM《Dehors（中法合唱版）》</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.甜甜的七月书单：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《海象日记》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《公正：何谓正当之为？》★</span></p><span></span><p><span>《激情耗尽》★</span></p><span></span><p><span>《快乐上等！》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《何为良好生活》★</span></p><span></span><p><span>《女性主义40年》</span></p>]]></description>
